 (name "Hall Effect Sensor (Linear)")
 (description "Ratiometric linear hall sensor. Power from 3.3 V so OUT never exceeds the RP2350 ADC range. Add a 100 nF capacitor from VCC to GND next to each sensor. OUT idles at VCC/2.")
